  "hints": [
    "Precompute total = sum(nums) in O(n), then maintain left_sum = 0 across one pass.",
    "At index i with value x, the strict right sum equals total - left_sum - x. Return i if left_sum == total - left_sum - x!",
    "Pseudocode:\n  total = sum(nums); left = 0\n  for i, x in enumerate(nums):\n      if left == total - left - x: return i\n      left += x\n  return -1"
